  "published": "2026-09-24T08:15:28.13Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- Product Improvement: Added first- and second-half player and team statistics (H1/H2) for football feed updates.\n          - Bug Fix: Corrected LiveScout MatchHeader.Active mapping from match list update active attribute values.\n          - Product Improvement: Exposed LiveScout OnLoginFailed event for scout login and IAM authentication failures.\n          - Technical Improvement: Added Common IAM support with JWT IAM and Standard OAuth configuration and token-based authentication.\n          - Technical Improvement: Enforced complete server certificate validation for TCP and HTTP connections.\n          - Technical Improvement: Hardened XML parsing to prohibit DTD processing and disable external entity resolution.\n          - Technical Improvement: Replaced hashing with SHA256.\n          - Vulnerability: Updated System.Net.Http dependency to address CVE-2018-8292.\n          - Vulnerability: Updated System.Text.RegularExpressions dependency to address CVE-2019-0820.\n          - Technical Improvement: Upgraded LiveData DataModel, Castle.Windsor, log4net, and Microsoft.Extensions dependencies.",
  "verbatimVersion": "1.1.22",
